{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0652F0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"1945年8月6日，广岛。9日，长崎……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":49,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"对日本的原子弹攻击，对吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"父亲一直是个只顾工作的人。我不记得休息日曾和他一起出去过。不过年幼的我也理解，他这样是为了家人，所以一直很尊敬他。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":171,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"母亲也经常对我说：“你爸爸是个了不起的科学家。他让很多美国年轻人免于对死亡的恐惧。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":126,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"“你要为爸爸感到骄傲。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"也有人认为，投下原子弹结束了那场大战……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"可我上小学五年级时，班里转来了一名日本学生。他给我看了一本记录广岛遭原子弹轰炸后景象的照片集。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":141,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"我简直不敢相信自己的眼睛。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"一座当时拥有35万人口的大城市，变成了一望无际的焦土。只因为一颗原子弹。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":104,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"木造建筑连根被掀飞，焚烧倒塌……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"仅存的，只有钢筋建筑的骨架。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"不只是建筑。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"路边被遗弃的焦黑遗体、全身遭受严重烧伤的受害者……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"听说原子弹投下后的几个月里，广岛有超过14万人死亡，长崎也有超过7万人死亡。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"从那以后，我一直没有和父亲说话。连看到他的脸都觉得厌恶。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"我明白你的感受，博士。但父亲终究是父亲。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"如果父亲没有参与核开发，我的身体也许不会变成这样。我的研究方向也可能完全不同。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"我也许能更加自由。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""}]}